      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_ce01e733c05fc445_0",
        "edit": "In the disabled branch (if(~ena)), change y=8'd1 to y=8'd0 so the decoder output is all-zero when ena is low, matching the oracle; also use blocking assignment consistently in the case branches.",
